<title>UK: ING Bank prices $50 mln eight-year bond.</title>
<headline>ING Bank prices $50 mln eight-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ING Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ING BANK, SAN PAULO BRANCH</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 COUPON     7.75	MATURITY    08.AUG.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    08.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  50 BP     REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	+170 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR</p>
<p> MGT/UND    25 BP     SELL CONC  25 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND THREE-YEAR UST</p>
<p> NOTES	THREE YEAR PUT AND CALL OPTION AT 99.30</p>
<p>		FIVE YEAR PUT AND CALL OPTION AT 99.40</p>
<p>		LAUNCHED OFF A GMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
